SUMMARY:Free Art Activity Day!
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**New Community Gathering 
 Space in Guerneville!**\n\nJoin **The Hangout** during River Arts’ 1st S
 aturday Art Walk for a special art show & activity day.\n\n**ART EXPLORATI
 ONS WITH TARA**\nI'll be there sharing FREE Zen Tangles art activity. A so
 othing\, repetitive\, and easy pattern-making type of creativity.\n\n* ***
 I'll also have art for sale\, starting at $5!***\n\nMake an afternoon of i
 t... Picnic in the redwoods\, enjoy nature\, shop small local artists\, an
 d learn some new creativity practices.\n\nFeaturing creatives from West Co
 unty.\nLet’s demystify creativity & get inspired to incorporate more art
 -making in daily life!\n\n**Featuring workshops and interactive activities
 :**\n\n* "Paint Like Bob Ross" - workshop with Silas\n* "Make a Macrame Wa
 ll Hanging" - workshop with Cass\n* "Creating Soul Collage" - workshop wit
 h Talia\n\n**WEBSITE** for more details: [https://www.favoritehangout.com/
 ](https://www.favoritehangout.com/)\n\nAll materials are included.\n$5 sug
 gested donation to cover material costs (no one turned away). Limited capa
 city at each workshop/activity\, first-come\, first-served!\n\nLocation\n1
 2060 Highway 116\nGuerneville\, CA 95446\n​\n\\~ Located where Localish 
 used to be\n\\~ 3 Minutes from downtown Guerneville\n\\~ 10 Minutes from F
 orestville
